    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6438" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναδεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soak, steep,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.13.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤθεσι ἀ. τοὺς νόμους</span>
			<i>imbue</i> them with moral principle, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Comp.Lyc.Num.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				10.6
			</span></i>: fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναδεύσομαι</span> in pass. sense, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.867
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mix into a paste,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ καὶ μέλιτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phylarch.
					26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.997a
			</span></i>.</div>
